Step 2 — vite.config.ts: Add server.proxy config to proxy '/api' to 'http://localhost:3001'. Full addition:
  server: {
    proxy: {
      '/api': {
        target: 'http://localhost:3001',
        changeOrigin: true,
      }
    }
  }
  Keep existing plugins, resolve.alias, and optimizeDeps unchanged.
